-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTICE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project builds on ai-job-search
(https://github.com/ai-job-search-dev/ai-job-search), an open-source job search
framework for Claude Code by Mads Lorentzen, released under the MIT License
(Copyright (c) 2026 Mads Lorentzen). The /scrape job-scraper skill, the
candidate profile files and the portal-skill pattern that the scheduled task and
the portal skills in this repository rely on come from that project. This
repository does not redistribute ai-job-search itself; users clone it
separately.

The portal skills in portals/ follow the structure of the ai-job-search portal
skills (SKILL.md, url-reference.md, cli/ with a Bun CLI and tests).
